rmat="epo"><country>US</country><doc-number>5629494</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="WO-1995004015-A1" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>WO</country><doc-number>1995004015</doc-number><kind>A1</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>DAICEL CHEM</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>WU JIANZHOU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>DAICEL CHEMICAL INDUSTRIES, LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>WU, JIANZHOU</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>WU JIANZHOU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>WU, JIANZHOU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A gas generator composition for airbags which is lowly toxic and has a high combustion rate and a low combustion temperature. The composition comprises (a) a bitetrazole compound as a fuel and (b) a basic metal nitrate as an oxidizing agent.  It preferably comprises 15 to 35 wt.% bitetrazole ammonium salt as the ingredient (a) and 65 to 85 wt.% basic copper nitrate as the ingredient (b).  It may further contain (c) a binder and/or a slug-forming agent.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention se rapporte à une composition génératrice de gaz pour airbag, qui est faiblement toxique et présente un taux de combustion élevé et une faible température de combustion. Cette composition comporte (a) un composé bitétrazole utilisé en tant que comburant et (b) un nitrate de métal basique utilisé en tant qu'agent oxydant. Elle contient de préférence 15 à 35 % en poids de sel d'ammonium de bitétrazole en tant que composé (a) et 65 à 85 % en poids de nitrate de cuivre basique en tant que composant (b). Cette composition peut également contenir (c) un liant et/ou un agent formateur de bouchons de gaz.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>